review.common:reviewDetails:
The review was performed in compliance with Arcadia Methodology “Metodologia per gli studi di filiera della Banca Dati italiana LCA”. The dataset has been assessed limited to the foreground data collected during the study.
Each dataset has been evaluated on the basis of the following 4 criteria:
1. Technological Representativeness; 
2. Time Representativeness; 
3. Geographical Representativeness;
4. Reliability.
In this contest the Reliability is good
